        "content": "# IMS DRILLING · 3 · Machine Detail\n\n[1 · Machine Cards](/d/ims-drilling-machine-cards/ims-drilling-machine-cards?orgId=1&${machine_id:queryparam}&${focus_machine:queryparam}&${status_filter:queryparam}&${event_filter:queryparam}&${program_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to}) · [2 · Fleet List](/d/ims-drilling-fleet-list/ims-drilling-fleet-list?orgId=1&${machine_id:queryparam}&${focus_machine:queryparam}&${status_filter:queryparam}&${event_filter:queryparam}&${program_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to}) · **[3 · Machine Detail](/d/ims-drilling-machine-detail/ims-drilling-machine-detail?orgId=1&${machine_id:queryparam}&${focus_machine:queryparam}&${status_filter:queryparam}&${event_filter:queryparam}&${program_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to})** · [4 · History](/d/ims-drilling-history/ims-drilling-history?orgId=1&${machine_id:queryparam}&${focus_machine:queryparam}&${status_filter:queryparam}&${event_filter:queryparam}&${program_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to}) · [5 · Anomaly Analysis](/d/ims-drilling-anomaly-analysis/ims-drilling-anomaly-analysis?orgId=1&${machine_id:queryparam}&${focus_machine:queryparam}&${status_filter:queryparam}&${event_filter:queryparam}&${program_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to}) · [6 · Settings](/d/ims-drilling-settings/ims-drilling-settings?orgId=1&${machine_id:queryparam}&${focus_machine:queryparam}&${status_filter:queryparam}&${event_filter:queryparam}&${program_search:queryparam}&${stale_hours:queryparam}&${stop_minutes:queryparam}&${alarm_burst:queryparam}&${raw_limit:queryparam}&from=${__from}&to=${__to})\n\n[← Apex 3 Floor 1 — 2D](/factory-twin-3d/?view=2d) · [← Apex 3 Floor 1 — 3D](/factory-twin-3d/?view=3d) · **Source:** `public.machine_event` · **Policy:** latest known state; no 15-minute expiry"
